    "description": "Review and promote staged wiki pages to their final locations. Use when WIKI_STAGED_WRITES=true and the user says \"/wiki-stage-commit\", \"review staged pages\", \"commit staged writes\", \"promote staged pages\", \"approve staged changes\", or \"what's waiting in staging\". Shows each staged file, lets the user accept or reject it, and moves accepted files to their final wiki locations. Rejected files are moved back to _raw/ for manual editing.\n",
